// The optimizer keeps the overflow check of each returned field, borrow or result whose proof went stale (default scalar construction); the program itself runs clean.
//@ slow
//@ opt: O3
//@ reason: the optimizer must not reuse a stale pointee or result proof
//@ run-pass
//@ revisions: base bad_default_explicit bad_default_native bad_default_other bad_default_lifetime bad_modified_prefix bad_modified_native bad_compound_prefix bad_compound_native
//@[bad_default_explicit] args: case
//@[bad_default_explicit] run-fail
//@[bad_default_explicit] exit-code: 70
//@[bad_default_explicit] stderr-contains: default_scalar_construction.gti:75: runtime error[GTI-R0001]: integer_overflow in addition
//@[bad_default_native] args: case case
//@[bad_default_native] run-fail
//@[bad_default_native] exit-code: 70
//@[bad_default_native] stderr-contains: default_scalar_construction.gti:134: runtime error[GTI-R0001]: integer_overflow in addition
//@[bad_default_other] args: case case case
