//@[bad_default_other] exit-code: 70
//@[bad_default_other] stderr-contains: default_scalar_construction.gti:142: runtime error[GTI-R0001]: integer_overflow in addition
//@[bad_default_lifetime] args: case case case case
//@[bad_default_lifetime] run-fail
//@[bad_default_lifetime] exit-code: 70
//@[bad_default_lifetime] stderr-contains: default_scalar_construction.gti:151: runtime error[GTI-R0001]: integer_overflow in addition
//@[bad_modified_prefix] args: case case case case case
