//@[bad_modified_native] run-fail
//@[bad_modified_native] exit-code: 70
//@[bad_modified_native] stderr-contains: default_scalar_construction.gti:100: runtime error[GTI-R0001]: integer_overflow in addition
//@[bad_compound_prefix] args: case case case case case case case
//@[bad_compound_prefix] run-fail
//@[bad_compound_prefix] exit-code: 70
